    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282286</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>水精石を１０個、渡しますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hand over 10 Aqua Spirit Gems?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そう言えばさ……
前にバジルさんに
頼まれ事してたよな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Now that I think of it...
Didn't Basil ask us
to do a favor for him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, now that I think of it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この時代では、まだバジルさんは
普通の人なんだよね……
シグルドとか関係なくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In this era, Basil's still just a
normal person, isn't he...?
He's not involved with Sigurd...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレさ……
どういう顔して会えば
いいか、わかんねよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I, uh... I'm not
really sure how to
act if we meet him...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、も……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Me, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもさ、ここで未来で
起きること教えてあげれば、
もしかしたら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But maybe, if
we told him what
will happen, he'd...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジルさんの未来を
変えることができる
かもしれない……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You think we might
be able to change
his future...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そうだとしても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Even if we could...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくはやらないほうが
いいと思うな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think it's better
if we don't...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしてだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もし、それでバジルさんが、
シグルドと関係なくなって、
普通に研究してたとして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, imagine if he never
joined Sigurd and just
kept researching like always...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、きみたちが
あの時代で経験したこと
ってなかったことになるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, would everything you
experienced in that era
never have happened?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはわからないけど……
でも、だとしても
何か不都合あるのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know...but,
even if that were true,
what's wrong with that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きみたちがここにいるのは、
虹輪があったからでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, the Prism Ring is
the reason you're here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>虹輪を止めるために
&lt;Arche&gt;に会って、
絵をもらって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To stop the Prism Ring,
you met with &lt;Arche&gt;
and got her paintings...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もとはと言えば、
そうだけど……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, that's
how it started, but...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……虹輪の原因は
魔科学兵器だった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I get it... The Prism Ring was
caused by the magitech weapon...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;の
魔科学兵器はシグルドが
占領した時に埋めた……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The magitech weapons in
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt; were buried there
when Sigurd occupied it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう。そいでシグルドが
魔科学兵器を使ってたのは
バジルさんが力を貸したから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. And Sigurd used
magitech weapons because
Basil was helping them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……バジルさんがシグルドと
関係なかったら、オレたち
ここにいないってことか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So if Basil never had
anything to do with Sigurd,
we wouldn't have come here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう……もし、&lt;Dio&gt;が
バジルさんに全部、
あったことを教えて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right... So, &lt;Dio&gt;,
if you told Basil
everything...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジルさんがシグルドに
入らなかったら……
おかしなことになるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then Basil never
joined Sigurd...everything
would be really weird.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、だからって！
黙ってらんねーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, and so what!?
I can't just not say anything!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うん……
わたし、も……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah. I
can't, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だったら、
会わずに帰る？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, let's leave
without seeing him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの……今、
君たち、バジル先生の
話してた？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uhh... Were you
talking about
Basil, just now?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、えっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、君たち、
もしかして&lt;Dio&gt;くんと
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, are you
&lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt;,
perhaps?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……どうしてそれを？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...? How did you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちっこい妖精くんを
連れてるって聞いたからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard you'd have a
tiny fairy with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はじめまして、
僕はバジル博士の助手を
してるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's nice to meet you.
I'm working as Prof.
Basil's assistant.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>助手の人……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Assistant...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は、はじめまして</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Nice to meet you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>せっかく訪ねてきてくれて
申し訳ないけど、
先生は長旅に出てるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I apologize for this, considering how far
you must have come to visit, but I'm afraid
Basil is on a long voyage at the moment.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もし、君たちが来たら、
ごめんねと伝えておいてって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He said, if you should happen to
come, to tell you he's very sorry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……あ、いえ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... Ah, no, um...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whew...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか
ほっとした、ような……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is kind
of a relief...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>で、なんかうちの先生が研究に
必要なものを君たちに頼んでた
って話を聞いたんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, I've also heard you
were entrusted with a task
to help with his research.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あぁ、あれ、か</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ohh, that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、まだだし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We don't have them yet...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか。それじゃあ、
もし、集まったら、
持ってきてくれるかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, huh. Well, if you do
gather enough, could
you bring them to me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、無理に、とは言わないから。
できれば、でいいからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, but you don't need to force
yourselves. Only if you're able to.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、ありがと。
いただくよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, thanks. Then,
I'll take these.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>先生も喜ぶよ、きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure the professor
will be happy, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、そうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, I see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね、先生が戻ってきて
から持ってきてくれたほうが
いいかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true. It might be better if
you waited for him to come back
and gave them to him yourself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また先生が戻ってきたら、
来てね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When he returns,
please do come.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>先生も君たちに
とても会いたがってたから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He was really hoping
to see you again, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、ええ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, um, sure...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ……また</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then... See you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり……あの人に……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have to... I have to see him...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だからダメだって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I said no!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
