    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Dio&gt;、割れた皿は
元に戻らない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A broken plate can never
be put back together, &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
